" edge="1" parent="1" source="profiles-avatar_path" target="storage-name"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="402" y="288.0"/><mxPoint x="402" y="480.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="Legend
PK  primary key  (underlined)
FK  foreign key  (italic)
UQ1  columns of one unique constraint
|| ---- O&lt;   one user : zero or many rows
|| ---- ||   one user : exactly one row
- - - - -   logical link (path, not an FK)

Every FK to auth.users is ON DELETE CASCADE.
goal_progress.goal_id is ON DELETE CASCADE.
RLS on every public table: a user can only
read and write rows where user_id = auth.uid().
Avatars live at avatars/&lt;uid&gt;/&lt;file&gt;; storage
policies limit each user to their own folder.
Signup trigger creates profiles + targets rows." style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B3B3B3;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="100" width="320" height="346" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="enums" value="Enum types (public)" style="shape=table;startSize=32;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fixedRows=1;rowLines=0;fontStyle=1;align=center;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="740" width="320" height="224" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="enum-gender-0" value="gender" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="enums"><mxGeometry y="32" width="320" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="enum-gender-1" value="female | male | other | prefer_not_to_say" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="enums"><mxGeometry y="56" width="320" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="enum-meal_kind-0" value="meal_kind" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="enums"><mxGeometry y="80" width="320" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="enum-meal_kind-1" value="breakfast | lunch | dinner | snack" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="enums"><mxGeometry y="104" width="320" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="enum-period_flow-0" value="period_flow" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="enums"><mxGeometry y="128" width="320" height="24" as="geome